description:
Ricky Limon’s Watch History has it all: reaction videos, 24 hour challenges, viral shorts, sound effects, and even his own childhood clips.

As he scrolls, Ricky shares the videos that make him cringe, what inspires his ideas, the creators he can’t stop watching, and how he produces his own videos. Plus, he revisits some very personal throwbacks he definitely didn’t plan on showing.

